  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "No longer has she "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "kept"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " in touch with us since she went abroad for further study."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "自从她出国留学后，就不再和我们保持联系了。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The man was so rude that I had to bite my tongue to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "keep from"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " getting into argument with him."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "那人如此无礼，我只好不做声，避免同他争辩。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "You must "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "keep to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the rules even if you think they’re unfair."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "尽管你认为这些规则不公正，但也得遵守。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "We have to work hard to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "keep up with"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " these excellent students."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "为了跟上那些优秀学生，我们得努力学习了。"
    }
  ],
